# bashbasicsbyvk_menus.list — which function owns which map.   map | function | kind | back-key
# bashbasicsbyvk_mapgen reads this, finds the function's source, harvests the commands its
# loop handles and writes  bashbasicsbyvk_<map>.map  +  bashbasicsbyvk_<map>menucommands.sh  (never overwriting hand edits).
main     | -                      | menu   | q
upgrade  | upgrade_menu           | menu   | u
switch   | switch_menu            | menu   | u
fx       | functions_menu         | menu   | u
rules    | rules_menu             | menu   | u
api      | api_menu               | menu   | u
snapshot | snapshot_menu          | menu   | u
xui      | _xui_loop              | menu   | u
find     | find_menu              | menu   | u
transfer | transfer_menu          | menu   | u
organise | organise_menu          | menu   | u
infinity | infinity_stones_menu   | menu   | u
home     | home_menu              | menu   | u
settings | settings_menu          | menu   | u
prompt   | -                      | prompt | u
rename   | _rename_single_mutation| prompt | u
